==Battleground==
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Vega (Enemy)|Vega]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Balrog (Enemy)|Balrog]] spawns.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Make sure you have some AOE attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Bird Cat]] to deal with the swarm of peons in this level. Balrog and Vega aren't too threatening due to Balrog's single attack and Vega's blindspot, as they can be easily penetrated by such attackers. If Vega's Freeze ability is still an issue, then a highly levelled [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]] is ideal for dealing with him.

